sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Simulator
  participant B as Broker
  participant A as API
  participant O as Operator
  A->>B: SUBSCRIBE telemetry (QoS 0)
  A->>B: SUBSCRIBE status, alerts (QoS 1)
  S->>B: SUBSCRIBE commands (QoS 1)
  loop each device, 5 s
    S->>B: PUBLISH telemetry
    B->>A: telemetry
  end
  O->>A: POST command
  A->>A: authorize()
  A->>B: PUBLISH command
  B->>S: command
  S->>S: validate limits, apply
  S->>B: PUBLISH status
  B->>A: status, twin updated
